    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33499" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαχύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάχεια</span> (not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῖα</span>,
			Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.249
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαχύ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small, short, mean, little</i>: old 
				Ep.
			Positive, whence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάσσων,
				ἐλάχιστος</span> are formed: in early 
				Ep.
			 only fem., <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				197
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.509
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάχεια</span>): in later 
				Ep.
			, Archyt.Amphiss.<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				324
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.480
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				37.314
			</span></i>: neut. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαχὺ σκάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.498
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.). (<i>leg[uglide]h-</i> or
				<i>leng[uglide]h-</i>, cf. Lat. <i>leuis</i>, Lith.
				<i>leñgvas</i> 'light'.)</div>
